# kanban-dispatch routing map: scope-tag -> tmux session.
# The first scope tag on a board card decides the owning session.
# ONE session per repo (the agent root that owns it). NO fallback:
# an unmapped scope is logged and NOT routed.
#
# Copy to sessions.conf and fill in your fleet.
#
# <scope-tag>        <tmux-session>
repo-alpha           alpha
repo-alpha-tools     alpha        # co-owned repo: same session
repo-beta            beta
paper-gamma          writing
